  "raw_text": "# Junior AI/ML Engineer\n\n*Location:* Kochi, Kerala  \n*Experience:* Fresher / 0–1 year\n\n## Job Description\nWe are looking for a motivated Junior AI/ML Engineer to support the development of machine learning models and AI-powered applications. The candidate should have a good foundation in Python, data processing, and machine learning concepts.\n\n## Required Skills\n- Python programming\n- Machine Learning fundamentals\n- Pandas and NumPy\n- Scikit-learn\n- Data cleaning and preprocessing\n- SQL\n- Natural Language Processing (NLP)\n- Data analysis and visualization\n- Git and GitHub\n- Problem-solving skills\n\n## Responsibilities\n- Clean, preprocess, and analyze datasets.\n- Build and evaluate machine learning models.\n- Apply machine learning algorithms to real-world problems.\n- Assist with NLP and text-processing tasks.\n- Evaluate model performance using appropriate metrics.\n- Collaborate with the team to develop AI solutions.\n- Maintain readable, well-documented code.\n\n## Qualifications\n- Bachelor's degree in Engineering, Computer Science, Artificial Intelligence, Data Science, or a related field.\n- Basic knowledge of machine learning algorithms and statistics.\n- Academic or personal AI/ML projects are an advantage.\n- Willingness to learn new tools and technologies.\n\n## Preferred Skills\n- Streamlit or Flask\n- Sentence Transformers and text embeddings\n- REST API basics\n- Familiarity with model deployment"
